# Only an open block's past due date gets the overdue icon; past start dates and done blocks do not.
file <<END
- Late @due({today-2})
- Started @start({today-2})
- Finished @due({today-3}) @done({today})
Old: @done
	- Inside old @due({today-4})
END
see - Late
see 󰨱 2 days ago
see 󱙭 2 days ago
see 󱙬 3 days ago
see 󱙬 4 days ago
hide 󰨱 3 days ago
hide 󰨱 4 days ago
